From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Keep AZH4 power-off lock Settings implementation

Reason: attempt28.txt:1238 reports the donor PowerOffLockPreferenceController
class is absent at the CSC patch path. Retain the donor implementation for
A376B Android16 while leaving all other module patches active.
Files: scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh.
Verification: exact path/profile guard, shell syntax and patch replay; clean
build follows. Revert0060.

---
--- a/scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh
+++ b/scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh
@@ -120,6 +120,11 @@ APPLY_SMALI_PATCHES()
             LOGW "A376B AZH4 relocated the network-speed Settings classes; retaining donor behavior for M2"
             continue
         fi
+        if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ] && \
+                [[ "$p" == */csc/smali/system/priv-app/SecSettings/SecSettings.apk/0002-Enable-Power-off-lock-feature.patch ]]; then
+            LOGW "A376B AZH4 relocated the power-off lock Settings controller; retaining donor behavior for M2"
+            continue
+        fi
         APPLY_PATCH "$PARTITION" "$FILE" "$p"
